    {
        "id": "ja:word:animals-horse",
        "label": "うま",
        "class": "lexical:noun",
        "fields": {
            "pronunciation": ["うま"],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "The animal horse. Japanese 馬 is read うま here, with two short morae. Plural horses has an extra syllable, /ˈhɔːsɪz/.",
                "de": "Das Tier Pferd. 馬 wird hier うま mit zwei kurzen Moren gelesen. Horses hat eine zusätzliche Silbe: /ˈhɔːsɪz/.",
                "id": "Hewan kuda. 馬 dibaca うま dengan dua mora pendek. Horses memiliki suku kata tambahan: /ˈhɔːsɪz/.",
                "ja": "動物の馬。ここで馬は短い二拍のうま。英語の複数形 horses は一音節増えて /ˈhɔːsɪz/。"
            },
